Exod 17:1 , The people murmur for water at Rephidim;
Exod 17:6 , God sends them for water to the rock in Horeb;
Exod 17:7 , The place is called Massah and Meribah;
Exod 17:8 , Amalek is overcome by Joshua, while Moses holds up his hands with the rod of God;
Exod 17:14 , Amalek is doomed to destruction; and Moses builds the altar JEHOVAH-nissi.
